er=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/6eae932c23fd32de5a2758134d4aae2d.poster.avif?t=1754247048\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/6eae932c23fd32de5a2758134d4aae2d.webm?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/6eae932c23fd32de5a2758134d4aae2d.mp4?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The pet you found snacking on your supplies seems to be growing more than expected. Far more. It might be wise to teach it what is right and wrong, before it grows too big to care about your opinions. Raise it, teach it spells or tricks, pet it, brush it, and if necessary discipline it. You might find that it becomes a trusted companion upon your journey! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/f5860420ad517a1d7270a8e02facfccf.poster.avif?t=1754247048\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/f5860420ad517a1d7270a8e02facfccf.webm?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/f5860420ad517a1d7270a8e02facfccf.mp4?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your units have a life of their own- they might form parties, fund their own buildings, or give each other quests.  Watch your dark alleys closely! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/fcd298af9fe3bb205bf04ca8d010df40.poster.avif?t=1754247048\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/fcd298af9fe3bb205bf04ca8d010df40.webm?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/fcd298af9fe3bb205bf04ca8d010df40.mp4?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As your adventurers clear the world of monsters, you can watch their pathetic struggle against the world. Be merciful and help them survive, get better items, and learn new skills... or feed them to your god-beast. Each level brings them one step closer towards a forbidden evolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/bca8d1f34bc443400912cb211af18721.poster.avif?t=1754247048\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/bca8d1f34bc443400912cb211af18721.webm?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/bca8d1f34bc443400912cb211af18721.mp4?t=1754247048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2>",
